# A lens on three files: `save`, `saveOutage` and `keepSummary` put a Reading, an Outage and a Summary into their
# files, and `history`, `kept` and `keptSummary` get each back as the type it was put as, or inside a Harvest. `summary`
# is the lens at work: the kept summary, else (`??`) one made from the day's readings and put. `keptSummary` runs
# whenever `summary` does, and `??` chooses only whether the right side runs, as the `None` arm of Rust's `match` does;
# `keptSummary` builds its Summary only when a line is found (`line && ..`, a choice as `||` is). The route of the
# exported class is its constructor and its public methods, each called by its caller and run on the caller's
# ReadingStore; what the constructor builds goes back to that caller. A library's operation whose result the body names (`find`, `map`) is a step; what it touches stays
# its caller's. Each file is read, used and written by the route: it stands on both sides.
#
# Issues marked: #101 a body's own use of a value it made; #125 which library operations are steps; #126 what the own
# arrow keeps; #130 which forms are choices.

route harvest.store.ReadingStore
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.save
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.history
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.history/Reading()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.saveOutage
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept/map
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept/Outage()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept/ReadingStore.history
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept/ReadingStore.history/Reading()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.kept/Harvest()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/ReadingStore.keptSummary   # #130: `??`'s left side runs whenever summary does
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/ReadingStore.keptSummary/find   # #130: `??`'s left side runs whenever summary does
choice ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/ReadingStore.keptSummary/?1   # #130: `line && ..`
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/ReadingStore.keptSummary/?1/Summary()   # #130
choice ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/ReadingStore.history
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/ReadingStore.history/Reading()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/daySummary
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/daySummary/map
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/daySummary/Summary()
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.summary/?1/ReadingStore.keepSummary
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.keptSummary
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.keptSummary/find
choice ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.keptSummary/?1   # #130: `line && ..`
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.keptSummary/?1/Summary()   # #130
step ReadingStore()/ReadingStore.keepSummary

